SET 1 LOGIC
Lateral → vertical power, then 90/90 lets the nervous system reset between explosive blocks while opening the hips.
SET 2 LOGIC
Single-leg → horizontal power, then couch stretch releases the anterior chain so he arrives at the hill with full stride length.
HILL RULE #1
Rest is the training. 2–3 min between every rep. Cut it short and you're doing conditioning — the opposite of speed development.
HILL RULE #2
Always open with 2–3 bodyweight sprints first, even in weeks 5+. Pattern first, load second, every session.
